      or operate another product or service.

      - You may make the private copies needed and let employees and contracted reviewers who
        take part in the same assessment use them, provided they comply with this section.
      - You may use your own API accounts, models, data and private hosting for this. Providers
        may process Work content only as needed to provide those services, with no independent
        reuse of it and no training on it.
      - Employers and paid recruiters may use the Work this way to assess the author. Any other
        evaluation use must be non-commercial.
      - Use is allowed only while a genuine assessment is under way. When it ends or is
        abandoned, delete the copies and modifications made under this section.
      - This does not permit sharing the Work or modified copies, except as section 3 allows.
        You may keep and share your own assessment, notes and measurements, provided they do
        not reproduce the Work beyond section 3. No permission is granted to incorporate the
        Work into a product, service or training dataset.
      - This grant covers only the author's rights, not rights in report excerpts, extracted
        figures, dependencies, models or other third-party material (see NOTICE.md).

   Nothing else is granted without permission.

